  "Every <color=white>5</color> seconds, Fire Rate, Bullet Size, and Bullet Speed are increased by <color=white>50%</color> for <color=white>3</color> seconds.\n\n> Fire Rate <color=white>+15%</color>": "お問い合わせ <color=white>5</color> 秒、火速、弾丸サイズ、弾丸速度が増加 <color=white>50%</color> お問い合わせ <color=white>3</color> 秒数。\n\n> 火力率 <color=white>+15%</color>",
  "Every <color=white>5</color> seconds, Fire Rate, Bullet Size, and Bullet Speed are increased by <color=white>50%</color> for <color=white>3</color> seconds.\n\nFire Rate <color=white>+15%</color>": "<color=white>5</color> 秒ごとに、発射速度、弾丸サイズ、弾速が <color=white>3</color> 秒間 <color=white>50%</color> 増加します。\n\n発射速度<color=white>+15%</color>",
