  "Every <color=white>6th</color> enemy killed revealed in <color=white>Vision</color> spawns a <color=white>Meteor</color> which deals <color=white>200%</color> Bullet Damage and leaves a temporary <color=white>Vision Circle</color>.\n\nInside Vision Damage Multiplier <color=white>+5%</color>\n": "<color=white>視界</color>で明らかになった<color=white>6人目</color>の敵を倒すごとに<color=white>メテオ</color>が生成され、<color=white>200%</color>の弾丸ダメージを与え、一時的な<color=white>視界サークル</color>を残します。\n\n内部視界ダメージ倍率<color=white>+5%</color>\n",
