  "Minibosses spawn <color=white>2</color> at a time and have <color=white>25%</color> more health.\n\n> EXP Gain <color=white>+15%</color>": "ミニボディスプーン <color=white>2</color> 時と共に <color=white>25%</color> より多くの健康。\n\n> EXPゲイン <color=white>+15%</color>",
  "Minibosses spawn <color=white>2</color> at a time and have <color=white>25%</color> more health.\n\nEXP Gain <color=white>+15%</color>": "ミニボスは一度に<color=white>2</color>匹出現し、体力が<color=white>25%</color>増加します。\n\nEXP獲得<color=white>+15%</color>",
  "Missile Damage <color=white>+100%</color>": "ミサイルダメージ<color=white>+100%</color>",
